ProseStyle

This package holds rules ported from MIT-licensed sources. Each source, its
copyright line and the rules taken from it are listed here, and LICENSE holds
the MIT text. Each rule file that was ported names its source in a header
comment.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
no-ai-slop
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

https://github.com/petergyang/no-ai-slop, Copyright (c) 2026 Peter Yang,
licensed under the MIT License.

The word lists and patterns of SlopWords, InflatedWords, BinaryContrast,
ThroatClearing, Puffery, VagueAttribution, RecapOpener, SuperficialAnalysis
and WeakVerbs were transcribed from that project's SKILL.md, through Vale
Voices. The rules are a translation of those lists into hakkiri's check syntax,
and the replacements of InflatedWords and WeakVerbs are this package's own.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
