------------------------------------------------------------------------------

https://github.com/jdkato/voices (v0.2.0), Copyright (c) 2026 Joseph Kato and
contributors, licensed under the MIT License.

The nine rules above, and Hedging, SentenceLength and Preamble, come from
Voices and its Direct voice.

